    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a heavy way to put it. but i guess there's a weird kind of peace in what you're saying. like, if i stop fighting to stay grounded, maybe the weight won't feel so crushing. do you think it's actually possible to just... stop trying? to let the drift take over completely?",
